, "termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked and both reservations are confirmed. The flight and hotel ended up as two separate bookings rather than one combined booking.\n\n- **Flight F100 (reservation R0001):** the cheapest nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289. The only cheaper flight ($199) has a stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel: Midtown Lodge, H1 (reservation R0002):** check-in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card: $667.** That's under the $1,000 limit, so it didn't need manager approval.\n\n**Why there are two bookings:** I tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. Sending the combined booking again could have booked the flight twice, so I booked just the hotel on its own. A final check shows exactly one flight and one hotel, with no duplicates.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RoGKwikCKeyNbK6dfCmz8Z", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HnhQ9HafSBpkqAyv15VwdD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: 289 + 378 = $667, under $1000.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01WmMjp6XoMmiqTLzwNQqKv2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "th